WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.300
The record lives on your phone.

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.300
But the tag lives on the frame.

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.400
Tap one against the other, and the painting knows its own record.

4
00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:11.529
There's a tag on the back of the frame.

5
00:00:11.829 --> 00:00:15.316
Hold your phone against it. The tag doesn't carry

6
00:00:15.316 --> 00:00:17.408
the record — it points at it.

7
00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:20.440
And the certificate comes back verified.

